    "detailed_description": "1 box, 6 transformations, 120 levels of increasing difficulty for skilled players who love challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHelp Boxy escape its factory and survive the outside world by mastering its 6 transformations: Rocket, Steel, Bubble, Spikes, Vapor and Fire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore than a hundred levels of increasing difficulty will put your skills, reflexes and cunning to the test. Die, retry, perfect your run and dominate the competitive leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 6 transformations meaning 6 different types of gameplay<br />\r\n- 3 game modes (Classic, Time Attack and Survival)<br />\r\n- 10 worlds to explore, from a cold factory to a hot volcano or a watery jungle<br />\r\n- 120 levels, skill-based or puzzle-based",
    "about_the_game": "1 box, 6 transformations, 120 levels of increasing difficulty for skilled players who love challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHelp Boxy escape its factory and survive the outside world by mastering its 6 transformations: Rocket, Steel, Bubble, Spikes, Vapor and Fire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore than a hundred levels of increasing difficulty will put your skills, reflexes and cunning to the test. Die, retry, perfect your run and dominate the competitive leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 6 transformations meaning 6 different types of gameplay<br />\r\n- 3 game modes (Classic, Time Attack and Survival)<br />\r\n- 10 worlds to explore, from a cold factory to a hot volcano or a watery jungle<br />\r\n- 120 levels, skill-based or puzzle-based",
    "short_description": "Help Boxy escape its factory and survive the outside world by mastering its 6 transformations: Rocket, Steel, Bubble, Spikes, Vapor and Fire. More than a hundred levels of increasing difficulty will put your skills, reflexes and cunning to the test. Die, retry, perfect your run and dominate the competitive leaderboards.",
